    "grounds": {
      "note": "灵心观 inside its 山门: the quartz square (stone lions and dragon pillars either side of the red door, the great censer in the middle); the main hall with 真武大帝's golden statue over the red altar table and the cushions before it; round arches east and west into the covered walkways that go round the courtyard (its flowers and trees, the well in the north-west corner; a wall on its south side, the hall behind it); the north walkway before the closed red door of the rear hall (张天师's portrait and sword, the masters' tablets), the training hall (wooden dummies, meridian charts) behind a door in the north-west, two guest rooms behind doors on the east side, the locked room west of the west walkway (drawn only); north-east, the mossy path of blue stones under tall pines leads round behind the rear hall to the two-storey 藏经楼 and its stone tablet.",
